OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters to climb city tower
OL,4,Ain 9/11 tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire crews from across Merseyside will
OL,7,Fpay tribute to the 343 firefighters who
OL,8,Fdied in the 9/11 attacks in a
OL,9,Ffundraising event later.
OL,11,FTeams of firefighters will climb St
OL,12,FJohns Beacon in Liverpool 343 times to
OL,13,Fraise money for firefighter charities
OL,14,Fin the UK and US.
OL,16,FEach ascent of the Liverpool landmark
OL,17,Fwill represent one of the firefighters
OL,18,Fwho lost their life while responding to
OL,19,Fthe attacks on the World Trade Center
OL,20,Fin New York on 11 September 2001.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
