OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters to climb city tower
OL,4,Ain 9/11 tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas Molyneux, of Merseyside Fire and
OL,7,FRescue Service, who organised the
OL,8,Fchallenge, said it was a way to "ensure
OL,9,Ftheir courage and selflessness are
OL,10,Fnever forgotten".
